`reference: Ninth Schedule item 6 to the short name the Second Schedule defines` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "Ninth Schedule item 6, the opening words and subparagraphs (א) and (ב), the words 'חוק התקשורת'"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the short name that item 1 of the Second Schedule defines for the Communications Law (Bezeq and Broadcasts), 5742-1982`
        `the target is` IS `item 1 of the Second Schedule as section 105 of the Communications (Broadcasts) Law, 5786-2026, rewrites it: it defines a short name for the Bezeq Law and defines no short name for the Communications Law`
        `the citing words take effect on before any postponement` IS JUST (Date 22 3 2027)
        `the citing words take effect no later than if every postponement is used` IS JUST (Date 22 7 2027)
        `the words stop reaching their text on` IS JUST (Date 28 7 2028)
        `read in context the citing words reach` IS NOTHING
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`

